OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son die after falling
OL,4,Ainto silage tank
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father and son have died after
OL,7,Ffalling into an industrial silage tank
OL,8,Fat a farm in Cheshire.
OL,10,FAlan Ford, 72, and his son Rick, 42,
OL,11,Fwere working on the farm in Aston by
OL,12,FBudworth, near Northwich, when they
OL,13,Ffell into the tank at about 12:20 BST
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FTributes were paid to them by the
OL,17,FCheshire Agricultural Society, which
OL,18,Fsaid Alan Ford was a former chairman.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
